    {
      "id": "15458fca5ddc33672b4175af",
      "title": "Paint",
      "summary": "A simple paint program for children, for the Atari ST. One colour for each mouse button. Sixteen-colour ST-low, a two-row palette, fill, shift, line, box, circle, spray, a couple of picture buffers, and load/save of .MAT files. Shareware, developed 1992–94. This is version 1.02 from the nostalgia pack I later put up for PaCifiST. The pack includes a sample…",
