    {
      "id": "739ea99afa1574a9675701f4",
      "title": "REview",
      "summary": "REview is a small ASCII file viewer for the Atari ST, written in GFA BASIC 3.5. It exists because the desktop’s built-in Show is not enough once you have a stack of coverdisk docs and want to search, bookmark, or print a paragraph. Find and repeat-find, ten bookmarks, goto line, block start/end, print block or whole document, toggle scan rate, and a 24-line…",
      "image": null,
