    {
      "id": "4cad27e210219f10769e5c74",
      "title": "Chaos Calc 2",
      "summary": "Chaos Calc 2 is my GEM-based Mandelbrot explorer for the Atari ST, written in GFA BASIC 3.5 and compiled. Zoom (almost) into infinity, cycle colours, swap palettes, and save plots as compact Chaos Definition Files or uncompressed Degas pictures. Shareware. Registration is £5, which unlocks Julia sets, extra CDF saves, colour-cycle direction, and desktop acc…",
